"faq-answer-inner\">\n              Pelanggan cukup membuka aplikasi kamera HP atau scanner QR code bawaan, lalu arahkan ke kartu QR yang tertempel di meja. Menu digital warungmu akan langsung terbuka di browser HP tanpa perlu install aplikasi tambahan. Praktis dan instan!\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n            <span>Apakah saya bisa tetap pakai Pesanlagi secara gratis?</span>\n            <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n              <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n            <div class=\"faq-answer-inner\">\n              Tentu saja! Paket Gratis Pesanlagi tersedia selamanya tanpa biaya. Kamu tetap bisa buat menu unlimited, generate QR code, dan pelanggan bisa scan tanpa batas. Paket Pro opsional hanya jika kamu butuh fitur custom warna, PDF high-res, dan support priority.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n          <button class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">\n            <span>Fitur apa saja yang tersedia di paket gratis?</span>\n            <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n              <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n            <div class=\"faq-answer-inner\">\n              Paket gratis meliputi: menu tak terbatas (unlimited), standard QR template, scan tanpa batas, hosting menu online, SSL keamanan, dan update menu real-time. Ada watermark kecil \"Powered by Pesanlagi\" di bagian bawah menu. Untuk menghapus watermark dan buka fitur premium, upgrade ke Paket Pro kapan saja.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"mt-7 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-green-500/8 border border-green-500/20 flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\">\n          <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-400\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.247-.694.247-1.289.173-1.413z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex-1\">\n          <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-green-300\">Masih bingung?</p>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-green-100/50\">Tim kami siap bantu via WhatsApp</p>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/6281234567890\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-400 text-white text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg transition 